version: 2.0.0
components:
  TasksSection:
    description: Tasks section shell in Platform UI — header band (title + live "{n} open · {n} in-flight · {n} unclaimed" stat off board.summary) and a Board|List|Inbox ViewSwitcher. Defaults to Board; renders the CalibrationStrip + FilterBar above the BoardView (Board tab only), the ListView for List, and an Inbox placeholder. 10s section-guarded poll drives fetchTasks + fetchBoard + fetchCalibration.
    type: view
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform]
  ListView:
    description: Priority-ranked vertical list of TaskCards (high → low) sourced from tasksStore. Handles loading/error/empty states.
    type: view
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform]
  TaskCard:
    description: Card cloning the lore-card structure — priority + status chips, line-clamped title, the prominent CalibrationBlock, a claimant chip colored via the shared AGENT_COLORS map, a fragile/symbol tag row, and a GitHub badge when external_ref.provider is github. Round D — clickable (onClick → store.openDetail(id), keyboard-accessible), an optional elevated `hero` variant for the Inbox, and live agent-effect registration via useTaskAgentEffect (symbol-matched pulse/color/label + badge stamps; keyed by taskId so the 10s poll re-render doesn't detach the highlight).
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform]
  CalibrationBlock:
    description: The calibration moat made visible. Largest non-title element on every card — big Fibonacci story-point number with a green LEARNED badge (◆ + n{count}) for learned estimates, or a dimmed italic ~prior~ label for cold-start guesses, plus the raw token band. Learned vs prior contrast is the headline.
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, moat]
  tasksStore:
    description: Zustand store mirroring loreStore's idiom. List state {tasks, loading, error, view} (intact from Round B) plus Round C board state {board, boardLoading, boardError} via fetchBoard() (GET /api/tasks/board), calibration state {calibration, calibrationLoading} via fetchCalibration() (GET /api/tasks/calibration), laneMode('claimant'|'state'|'symbol') persisted to localStorage, filter {status,priority,search} + calibrationFilter {archetype,taskType} with setters. Round D adds inbox state {whoami (cached human claimant), inboxClaimant, inboxTasks, inboxLoading, inboxError} via fetchWhoami() (GET /api/tasks/whoami, cached) + fetchInbox(kind, ref) (GET /api/tasks/inbox?kind=&ref=) + setInboxClaimant(), and detail state {selectedTaskId} via openDetail(id)/closeDetail(). Each fetch has its own AbortController. Default view is 'board'.
    type: state
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, state]
  storyPoints:
    description: Pure helper tokenBandToPoints({min,max}) → Fibonacci story point (1/2/3/5/8/13/21) by mapping the band midpoint through tunable token thresholds (POINT_THRESHOLDS), to be re-fit against real actuals later.
    type: util
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, calibration]
  board-utils:
    description: Board helpers — AGENT_COLORS (verbatim from TeamSection) + claimantColor(), deriveSymbols()/firstSymbol() (tags + blurb-parsed #symbols, the board fragileSymbols fallback), nodeToTask()/unclaimedToTask() normalizers so TaskCard renders board nodes verbatim, sortCards() (in-progress first then priority-desc), matchesFilter(), sumPoints() (lane story-point total).
    type: util
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, board]
  BoardView:
    description: Horizontally-scrollable row of SwimLanes off /api/tasks/board. laneMode='claimant' (default) = one lane per claimant.ref + trailing Unclaimed lane (board.unclaimed) + collapsed Done lane; 'state' = open/in-progress/done/shelved kanban; 'symbol' = grouped by each card's first derived symbol. Honors store status/priority/search + calibrationFilter (archetype×taskType).
    type: view
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, board]
  SwimLane:
    description: Single vertical board lane — colored header (label + presence dot + card count + SUMMED story points) using AGENT_COLORS, a scrollable column of TaskCards sorted in-progress-first then priority-desc, collapsible via chevron with per-lane localStorage persistence.
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, board]
  LaneModeToggle:
    description: Segmented pill (Claimant | State | Symbol/Flow) that sets store.laneMode.
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, board]
  FilterBar:
    description: Tasks filter bar lifted from lore's pattern — status dropdown, priority dropdown, search-blurb input wired to store filter state, plus a clearable active-filter chip surfacing the calibrationFilter (archetype×taskType) when set.
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform]
  CalibrationStrip:
    description: Default-ON collapsible hero strip ABOVE the board (not a tab) off /api/tasks/calibration. Leads with a coverage StatCard ("{pct}% calibrated cells · {graduated} of {total} graduated") + a "learning in progress" badge on full cold-start, then the CellGrid. Collapse state persisted to localStorage.
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, moat]
  CellGrid:
    description: Calibration matrix — archetype rows × taskType columns. Learned cells render solid + agent-color tint + a ● dot + compact band ("3–13" n24); prior cells render dimmed/italic/dashed with a "░" mark (intentional cold-start). Clicking a cell toggles the store calibrationFilter that BoardView honors and FilterBar surfaces as a chip.
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, moat]
  InboxView:
    description: The Inbox tab — the AGENT FACE. A claimant pill-row (a "Me" pill resolved via /api/tasks/whoami + one AGENT_COLORS-tinted pill per distinct board claimant) selects whose inbox to focus via fetchInbox(kind, ref). The focused column shows a rolled-up calibration header ("calibration {pct}% · n={total}", share of source==='learned'), a NEXT-ACTIONABLE hero card (highest-priority in-progress-or-open, not blocked) elevated on top, a DependsChain ribbon under the hero (●done → ●this → ○next, best-effort state resolution from the board/inbox pool), then the rest as a queued list of TaskCards. Cold-start default landing is the human's ("Me") inbox; empty claimants render "inbox zero".
    type: view
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, inbox]
  GitHubSyncStrip:
    description: Persistent Board-tab footer. Aggregates external_ref state across visible board tasks — synced (provider==='github' && url), push-pending (github && no url), drifted (future state, 0 for now). "Pull from GitHub" is AFFORDANCE-ONLY — opens a popover that shows + clipboard-copies the `paradigm task sync` CLI command with a note that two-way sync runs via the CLI today. Calls no mutating endpoint (the read router has none).
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, github]
  TaskDetailPanel:
    description: Right-slide detail panel cloning lore's .detail-overlay/.detail-panel. Opened by clicking any TaskCard (store.openDetail(id)); fetches GET /api/tasks/:id (seeded instantly from the already-loaded board/inbox/list pool). Shows full blurb, the dependsOn DAG (ids + resolved states), the estimate breakdown (token band + LEARNED/prior provenance + n), fragileSymbols/tags chips, a GitHub section (ref + link when url present), and related_lore ids. Closes on backdrop click / Esc.
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform]
  useTaskAgentEffect:
    description: Hook consuming the shared agentStore the SAME way the platform's agent-effect protocol works — matched by SYMBOL (not taskId). A card registers its derived symbols (board.deriveSymbols) and intersects them against agentStore.highlights[].symbols (pulse + color + label) and agentStore.annotations of type 'badge' (symbol-targeted badge stamps). Mute clears agentStore, so a muted session yields no card effects for free.
    type: util
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, agent-effects]
